flowchart TD
  A([Client request]) --> B[Edge accepts HTTPS]
  B --> C[Gateway validates request framing]
  C --> D[Create trusted request context]
  D --> E[Resolve public method and path]
  E --> F{Route registered?}
  F -->|No| X404[404 route not found]
  F -->|Yes| G[Verify identity when required]
  G --> H{Identity valid?}
  H -->|No| X401[401 unauthenticated]
  H -->|Yes| I[Evaluate route permission]
  I --> J{Allowed?}
  J -->|No| X403[403 forbidden]
  J -->|Yes| K[Check quota and concurrency]
  K --> L{Within policy?}
  L -->|No| X429[429 rate limited]
  L -->|Yes| M[Resolve fixed upstream]
  M --> N[Forward filtered request with deadline]
  N --> O[Normalize response or failure]
  O --> P[Emit redacted telemetry]
  P --> Q([Return public response])
